Low-controversy, recorded so that silence is not mistaken for agreement: **(D-08)** English deliverable with the Chinese companion; **(D-09)** the fixed caption and filename standard of Section H.2; **(D-11)** Packet Tracer is kept, strictly as a **design-time** tool, labelled as such in every figure. Full recommendations are in Section A.

